abic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/85.html\">Sura Al-Burooj</a> › Aya 2</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Burooj 85:2</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَالْيَوْمِ الْمَوْعُودِ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Da yinin da aka yi alkawarin zuwansa,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ثم أقسم باليوم الموعود وهو يوم القيامة وهو المقسم به وعليه<cite>«التبيان في أقسام القرآن» 1/89</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s85a2\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/85-1.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (85:1)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/85-10.html\">Aya ta gaba (85:10)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-10.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Burooj 85:10 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Lalle ne waɗanda suka fitini mũminai maza da mũminai mãta, sa&#x27;an nan ba su tũba ba to, sunã da azãbar Jahannama, kuma sunã da azãbar gõbara.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Burooj 85:10 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Lalle ne waɗanda suka fitini mũminai maza da mũminai mãta, sa&#x27;an nan ba su tũba ba to, sunã da azãbar Jahannama, kuma sunã da azãbar gõbara.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Burooj\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/85.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 10\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-10.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/85.html\">Sura Al-Burooj</a> › Aya 10</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Burooj 85:10</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ الَّذِينَ فَتَنُوا الْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَتُوبُوا فَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ الْحَرِيقِ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Lalle ne waɗanda suka fitini mũminai maza da mũminai mãta, sa&#x27;an nan ba su tũba ba to, sunã da azãbar Jahannama, kuma sunã da azãbar gõbara.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فسرت الفتنة هاهنا بتعذيبهم المؤمنين، وإحراقهم إياهم بالنار، واللفظ أعم من ذلك<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 3/151</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ويدعوهم إلى التوبة وقد حاربوه وعذبوا أولياءه وأحرقوهم بالنار.<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/317</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s85a10\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/85-2.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (85:2)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/85-14.html\">Aya ta gaba (85:14)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-14.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Burooj 85:14 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kuma Shi ne Mai gãfara, Mai bayyana sõyayya.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-14.html\">\n